    askpass,
    callr,
    commonmark,
    ellmer (>= 0.5.0),
    htmltools,
    httpuv,
    jsonlite,
    keyring (>= 1.3.0),
    knitr,
    later,
    remotes,
    rlang,
    rstudioapi,
    shiny (>= 1.14.0)
Suggests:
    httr2,
    pdftools
URL: https://github.com/MySimpleSmart/RAssistant
BugReports: https://github.com/MySimpleSmart/RAssistant/issues
Config/RAssistant/Changes: Show the active provider and exact model beside Send. Keep the label up to date after model or provider changes, with long IDs wrapping inside narrow Viewers.
    Click the model label to choose a model or provider in a compact picker. Reuse its saved key, load available model IDs on request, and keep the conversation and draft. API settings remains available for managing keys.
    Block model changes while a request or run approval is active. Read composer model metadata locally without credential lookups, and never use cached key fields from another settings form.
